97\" class=\"\"><span data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1155\">Low Power Consumption</span> for energy-efficient network performance.</p><p>\n</p></li><li data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1259\" class=\"\"><p>\n</p><p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1259\" class=\"\"><span data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1222\">Wide Compatibility</span> – works with popular OLT/ONU brands.</p><p>\n</p></li></ul>\n<p data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1278\" class=\"\"><span data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1278\">Applications:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1406\"><li data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1305\" class=\"\"><p>\n</p><p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1305\" class=\"\">Fiber to the Home (FTTH)</p><p>\n</p></li><li data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1341\" class=\"\"><p>\n</p><p data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1341\" class=\"\">Internet Service Providers (ISPs)</p><p>\n</p></li><li data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1378\" class=\"\"><p>\n</p><p data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1378\" class=\"\">Data Centers &amp; Enterprise Networks</p><p>\n</p></li><li data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1406\" class=\"\"><p>\n</p><p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1406\" class=\"\">Optical Network Equipment</p></li></ul><p><br></p>","detailsHtml":"<p>PON SFP Module</p>","topDesc":"","subcats":[],"products":[{"id":"579","name":"OTECH EPON OLT PON SFP Module E14D9PX20 Optical Transceiver","href":"/fttx-solution/pon-sfp-module/otech-epon-olt-pon-sfp-module-e14d9px20-optical-transceiver","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/E14D9PX20+++/OTECH%20EPON%20OLT%20PON%20SFP%20Module%20E14D9PX20%20Optical%20Transceiver%20P2-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"imageSecond":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/E14D9PX20+++/OTECH%20EPON%20OLT%20PON%20SFP%20Module%20E14D9PX20%20Optical%20Transceiver%20P1-250x250.jpg.webp","width":250,"height":250},"price":"1,900৳","oldPrice":"2,000৳","label":"-5 %","requestPrice":false,"brand":{"name":"OTECH","href":"/otech"},"model":"E14D9PX20+++","features":["Model: E14D9PX20+++","Da